# The site image builds from source, so it needs the game and nothing else.
# Everything else in the repository - node_modules, the iOS project, the sync
# service, tests and review captures - would be uploaded to the builder on
# every deploy and never used.
#
# This file sits beside web/Dockerfile under BuildKit's per-Dockerfile name,
# so it takes the place of the repository's root .dockerignore (which is the
# sync service's) for this image only. web/fly.toml points flyctl at it too.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!index.html
!vite.config.ts
!tsconfig.json
!src/
!src/**
!public/
!public/**
!web/Dockerfile
!web/Caddyfile
!web/404.html
!web/precompress.mjs
